    "verification": "Every call compares all 16 projection matrix words against the actual C_MTXOrtho body (fixture noinline/noclone prevents constant specialization), then all 7 live compact GX words. Prior projection and viewport state is changed between calls.",
    "rounding": "Round-to-nearest host float arithmetic. No arbitrary rounding-mode, exception-status or SH-4 DN/trap equivalence claim.",
    "empty_edges": "Actual GXLoadPosMtxImm and GXSetCurrentMtx bodies are included and are no-ops. Their counted calls fall from 256 to 0 when native message fast path is effective; with NATIVE_MES=0 they remain 256 in both arms."
